flowchart TD
    A[Absolute command and minimal environment] --> B[Start process group or Windows Job Object]
    B --> C[Drain stdout and stderr concurrently]
    C --> D{Child and both streams finished?}
    D -- yes --> E[Return exit classification and duration]
    D -- no --> F{Wall or idle deadline reached?}
    F -- no --> C
    F -- yes --> G[Terminate the whole process tree]
    G --> H[Return timeout or idle result]
